{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Costas sold two televisions for €198 each. From the sale of the first one he made a profit of 10% on its value and from the sale of the second one, he had a loss of 10% on its value. After the sale of the two televisions Costas had in total\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/158c1f41bf40c6ef5e633493ddd936385e288d41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\mathrm{profit\\ }4\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\mathrm{neither\\ profit\\ nor\\ loss}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\mathrm{loss\\ } 8\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\mathrm{profit\\ }8\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{loss\\ } 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"670\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the TV original prices are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21b1ff644df9c7d00ab423df91384f076fa26b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,\\ y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"33\" height=\"11\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/207fcd71620790255ec25d2dadbbbfb209ec22a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{10}x = 198$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3cba1d9871618091e105b0b54cd16de6310cd6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 9{10}y = 198$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809ae11f8316ba1e1c0608ff6ba1413b620cf8aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/19247c32847819879cb0039f1afce2c7465a8d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 220$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> totaling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />; he loses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c634d06b7a357daa05866fe494095135c9ad1d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(198) - 400 = -4 \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"212\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_23\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td 